      "figure_refs": [],
      "source_text": "980. 化简：а) $3\\sqrt{48}-\\sqrt{75}+\\frac{1}{7}\\sqrt{147}$；б) $\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{200}+2\\sqrt{50}-4\\sqrt{8}$；в) $8\\sqrt{2\\frac{3}{4}}-\\sqrt{44}-\\sqrt{275}+14\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{49}}$；г) $\\sqrt{1300}-2\\sqrt{52}-12\\sqrt{1\\frac{4}{9}}+5\\sqrt{3\\frac{1}{4}}$；д) $\\sqrt{2}-\\frac{1}{9}\\sqrt{162}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{27}+\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{300}$；е) $\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}-\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}}-3\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}+1.7\\sqrt{6}$；ж) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}+1.5\\sqrt{200}-12\\sqrt{1\\frac{1}{8}}+\\frac{1}{24}\\sqrt{88^2-56^2}$；з) $10\\sqrt{245}-\\frac{200}{\\sqrt{5}}-\\frac{1}{4}\\sqrt{3.2}-2.5\\sqrt{180}-\\frac{10}{3}\\sqrt{45}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{20}}$。",
      "modern_text": "980. 化简：\na) $3\\sqrt{48}-\\sqrt{75}+\\frac{1}{7}\\sqrt{147}$；\nb) $\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{200}+2\\sqrt{50}-4\\sqrt{8}$；\nc) $8\\sqrt{2\\frac{3}{4}}-\\sqrt{44}-\\sqrt{275}+14\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{49}}$；\nd) $\\sqrt{1300}-2\\sqrt{52}-12\\sqrt{1\\frac{4}{9}}+5\\sqrt{3\\frac{1}{4}}$；\ne) $\\sqrt{2}-\\frac{1}{9}\\sqrt{162}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{27}+\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{300}$；\nf) $\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}-\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{2}}-3\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{6}}+1.7\\sqrt{6}$；\ng) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}+1.5\\sqrt{200}-12\\sqrt{1\\frac{1}{8}}+\\frac{1}{24}\\sqrt{88^2-56^2}$；\nh) $10\\sqrt{245}-\\frac{200}{\\sqrt{5}}-\\frac{1}{4}\\sqrt{3.2}-2.5\\sqrt{180}-\\frac{10}{3}\\sqrt{45}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{20}}$。",
      "hashes": {
        "raw_record_sha256": "31cad6730deeb61ec78a957e67744adf2ae16fb98062f1d6d80d23f9bbdb1a2b",
        "raw_text_sha256": "a97151d4bf3922857ce20c24500a73e73453d38f370e1f8c92540fb7040fa2c5",
        "modern_record_sha256": "15a165c5900d999f03821dc9ad98fcf40b2c8a7f47f7dfc11c3a5fceb7d4c1c1",
        "modern_text_sha256": "97f554e563e8a7a355c2fbdfbea25e61fc99b711a7c2617d7d04c113ef88ca74"
      },
      "task": "Simplify principal-root expressions.",
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "a", "source_label": "а", "answer": "8\\sqrt{3}",
          "domain": "Real constant; radicands 48,75,147 are positive; denominator 7 is nonzero.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(48)=4sqrt(3), sqrt(75)=5sqrt(3), sqrt(147)=7sqrt(3). The coefficient is 3*4-5+7/7=8."
        },
        {
          "label": "b", "source_label": "б", "answer": "4\\sqrt{2}",
          "domain": "Real constant; radicands 200,50,8 are positive; denominator 5 is nonzero.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(200)=10sqrt(2), sqrt(50)=5sqrt(2), sqrt(8)=2sqrt(2). The coefficient is 10/5+2*5-4*2=4."
        },
        {
          "label": "c", "source_label": "в", "answer": "-\\sqrt{11}",
          "domain": "Real constant; mixed number 2 3/4=11/4; every radicand is positive and denominators 4,49 are nonzero.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(11/4)=sqrt(11)/2, sqrt(44)=2sqrt(11), sqrt(275)=5sqrt(11), sqrt(11/49)=sqrt(11)/7. The coefficient is 4-2-5+2=-1."
        },
        {
          "label": "d", "source_label": "г", "answer": "\\frac{9}{2}\\sqrt{13}",
          "domain": "Real constant; mixed numbers 1 4/9=13/9 and 3 1/4=13/4; all radicands are positive and denominators nonzero.",
          "derivation": "The four terms become 10sqrt(13), -4sqrt(13), -4sqrt(13), and (5/2)sqrt(13). Their coefficient is 10-4-4+5/2=9/2."
        },
        {
          "label": "e", "source_label": "д", "answer": "0",
          "domain": "Real constant; all radicands are positive; denominators 9,3,5 are nonzero.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(162)=9sqrt(2), sqrt(27)=3sqrt(3), sqrt(300)=10sqrt(3). Thus sqrt(2)-sqrt(2)-2sqrt(3)+2sqrt(3)=0."
        },
        {
          "label": "f", "source_label": "е", "answer": "\\frac{9}{20}\\sqrt{6}",
          "domain": "Real constant; radicands 2/3,3/2,1/6,6 are positive; all denominators nonzero. Decimal 1.7 is exactly 17/10.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(2/3)=sqrt(6)/3, sqrt(3/2)=sqrt(6)/2, sqrt(1/6)=sqrt(6)/6. The coefficient is 1/2-5/4-1/2+17/10=9/20."
        },
        {
          "label": "g", "source_label": "ж", "answer": "\\frac{19}{2}\\sqrt{2}",
          "domain": "Real constant; sqrt(2)>0; mixed number 1 1/8=9/8 and 88^2-56^2=4608>0; denominators 8,24 are nonzero.",
          "derivation": "3/sqrt(2)=(3/2)sqrt(2); 1.5sqrt(200)=15sqrt(2); sqrt(9/8)=3sqrt(2)/4; sqrt(4608)=48sqrt(2). The coefficient is 3/2+15-9+2=19/2."
        },
        {
          "label": "h", "source_label": "з", "answer": "\\frac{23}{5}\\sqrt{5}",
          "domain": "Real constant; 3.2=16/5 and 2.5=5/2 exactly; all radicands are positive; sqrt(5),sqrt(20),4,3 are nonzero.",
          "derivation": "The terms become 70sqrt(5), -40sqrt(5), -(1/5)sqrt(5), -15sqrt(5), -10sqrt(5), -(1/5)sqrt(5). In particular sqrt(16/5)=4sqrt(5)/5 and 2/sqrt(20)=sqrt(5)/5. The total coefficient is 70-40-1/5-15-10-1/5=23/5."
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "exercise": "981",
