      "figure_refs": [],
      "source_text": "981. 化简：а) $\\sqrt{25m^5}+4m\\sqrt{m^3}-m^2\\sqrt{m}$；б) $\\sqrt{81a^3}-5a\\sqrt{a}+\\frac{3}{a}\\sqrt{4a^5}$。",
      "modern_text": "981. 化简：\na) $\\sqrt{25m^5}+4m\\sqrt{m^3}-m^2\\sqrt{m}$；\nb) $\\sqrt{81a^3}-5a\\sqrt{a}+\\frac{3}{a}\\sqrt{4a^5}$。",
      "hashes": {
        "raw_record_sha256": "b5edf9aba1ad0204f18cdc019d6afac983ca4042d0772ce912b54f47aa04b8e8",
        "raw_text_sha256": "4621e09d15eaee63ae8382e1d0e15495894a4a2a671b35035f9099faf0496bae",
        "modern_record_sha256": "0bbd2e0594e8159b6cb6a04f7ed308f3325ae299b0036fa0afb4a0124360daf8",
        "modern_text_sha256": "c1f002b12fc892034c689e84e12a70b958b7684a364d5b41b9ebd56f943bbdba"
      },
      "task": "Simplify on the full original real domain.",
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "a", "source_label": "а", "answer": "8m^2\\sqrt{m}",
          "domain": "m>=0, from sqrt(m); no denominator. The boundary m=0 is allowed.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(25m^5)=5sqrt(m^4)sqrt(m)=5m^2sqrt(m). Since m>=0, sqrt(m^3)=|m|sqrt(m)=m sqrt(m). Thus (5+4-1)m^2sqrt(m)=8m^2sqrt(m), also valid at m=0."
        },
        {
          "label": "b", "source_label": "б", "answer": "10a\\sqrt{a}",
          "domain": "a>=0 from the roots and a!=0 from 3/a, hence a>0. Do not restore a=0 after cancellation.",
          "derivation": "For a>0, sqrt(81a^3)=9a sqrt(a) and sqrt(4a^5)=2a^2sqrt(a). Therefore 9a sqrt(a)-5a sqrt(a)+(3/a)*2a^2sqrt(a)=(9-5+6)a sqrt(a)=10a sqrt(a)."
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "exercise": "982",
      "source_number": "982",
      "group": "第41小节",
      "group_id": "g10",
      "pages": ["p0296#3", "p0297#1"],
      "figure_refs": [],
      "source_text": "982. 分解因式：а) $\\sqrt{30}-2\\sqrt{6}$； б) $3\\sqrt{14}+\\sqrt{2}$；в) $10-3\\sqrt{10}$； г) $\\sqrt{35}-5$；д) $a-\\sqrt{ab}$，其中$a>0$，$b>0$；е) $\\sqrt{ax}+x\\sqrt{a}$； ж) $a\\sqrt{2b}-b\\sqrt{2a}$；з) $x^2\\sqrt{y}+y^3\\sqrt{x}$； и) $a^2-10$；к) $a^4-b$，其中$b>0$；л) $25a-16b$，其中$a>0$，$b>0$；м) $3a^2-2b^2$。",
      "modern_text": "982. 分解因式：\na) $\\sqrt{30}-2\\sqrt{6}$；\nb) $3\\sqrt{14}+\\sqrt{2}$；\nc) $10-3\\sqrt{10}$；\nd) $\\sqrt{35}-5$；\ne) $a-\\sqrt{ab}$，其中$a>0$，$b>0$；\nf) $\\sqrt{ax}+x\\sqrt{a}$；\ng) $a\\sqrt{2b}-b\\sqrt{2a}$；\nh) $x^2\\sqrt{y}+y^3\\sqrt{x}$；\ni) $a^2-10$；\nj) $a^4-b$，其中$b>0$；\nk) $25a-16b$，其中$a>0$，$b>0$；\nl) $3a^2-2b^2$。",
      "hashes": {
        "raw_record_sha256": "daeb4d4a0cc22e9ff4d143d12b81777aa340cb017b9892a7165e5b753dd63dbb",
        "raw_text_sha256": "bbca912aa1fc49bca1684359f681fb112da05c6f856b945160c42beca6215bff",
        "modern_record_sha256": "ee07412b5e2487fe68e885217aa3ab6e0e21e1797814806c89020d5a1c1f2be0",
        "modern_text_sha256": "a53d8c21885668ae5b9499302da84b41824fe7137cd1126e97c2c9e43324f16b"
      },
      "task": "Factor, retaining original domains and equality with the expanded source expressions.",
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "a", "source_label": "а", "answer": "\\sqrt{6}(\\sqrt{5}-2)",
          "domain": "Real constant; all roots positive; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(30)=sqrt(6)sqrt(5). Expansion gives sqrt(30)-2sqrt(6)."
        },
        {
          "label": "b", "source_label": "б", "answer": "\\sqrt{2}(3\\sqrt{7}+1)",
          "domain": "Real constant; all roots positive; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(14)=sqrt(2)sqrt(7). Expansion gives 3sqrt(14)+sqrt(2)."
        },
        {
          "label": "c", "source_label": "в", "answer": "\\sqrt{10}(\\sqrt{10}-3)",
          "domain": "Real constant; sqrt(10)>0; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "10=(sqrt(10))^2. Expansion gives 10-3sqrt(10)."
        },
        {
          "label": "d", "source_label": "г", "answer": "\\sqrt{5}(\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{5})",
          "domain": "Real constant; all roots positive; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "sqrt(35)=sqrt(5)sqrt(7) and 5=(sqrt(5))^2. Expansion gives sqrt(35)-5."
        },
        {
          "label": "e", "source_label": "д", "answer": "\\sqrt{a}(\\sqrt{a}-\\sqrt{b})",
          "domain": "a>0 and b>0, as explicitly stipulated; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "For the stipulated domain, sqrt(a)sqrt(b)=sqrt(ab) and (sqrt(a))^2=a. Expansion gives a-sqrt(ab)."
        },
        {
          "label": "f", "source_label": "е",
          "answer": "\\begin{cases}\\sqrt{a}(\\sqrt{x}+x),&a>0,\\ x\\ge0,\\\\0,&a=0,\\ x\\in\\mathbb{R}.\\end{cases}",
          "domain": "a>=0 and ax>=0; equivalently (a>0 and x>=0) or (a=0 and x any real). No denominator.",
          "derivation": "For a>0, ax>=0 forces x>=0, so sqrt(ax)=sqrt(a)sqrt(x); expansion of sqrt(a)(sqrt(x)+x) gives the source. For a=0, the original is sqrt(0*x)+x sqrt(0)=0 for every real x, including negative x.",
          "interpretation_note": "The source supplies no explicit x>=0 restriction. Writing sqrt(a)(sqrt(x)+x) alone would omit valid points a=0,x<0; the piecewise result preserves them without changing the source."
        },
        {
          "label": "g", "source_label": "ж", "answer": "\\sqrt{2ab}(\\sqrt{a}-\\sqrt{b})",
          "domain": "a>=0 and b>=0, forced independently by sqrt(2a),sqrt(2b); no denominator. Zero boundaries are allowed.",
          "derivation": "Expansion gives sqrt(2ab)sqrt(a)-sqrt(2ab)sqrt(b)=sqrt(2a^2b)-sqrt(2ab^2)=a sqrt(2b)-b sqrt(2a), since a,b>=0. No division by a or b is used."
        },
        {
          "label": "h", "source_label": "з", "answer": "\\sqrt{xy}(x\\sqrt{x}+y^2\\sqrt{y})",
          "domain": "x>=0 and y>=0, forced by the original separate roots; no denominator. Zero boundaries are allowed.",
          "derivation": "Expansion gives x sqrt(xy)sqrt(x)+y^2sqrt(xy)sqrt(y)=x sqrt(x^2y)+y^2sqrt(xy^2)=x^2sqrt(y)+y^3sqrt(x), since |x|=x and |y|=y."
        },
        {
          "label": "i", "source_label": "и", "answer": "(a-\\sqrt{10})(a+\\sqrt{10})",
          "domain": "a any real; no variable radicand or denominator.",
          "derivation": "The cross terms cancel in the difference of squares, leaving a^2-(sqrt(10))^2=a^2-10. No assumption a>=0 is needed."
        },
        {
          "label": "j", "source_label": "к", "answer": "(a^2-\\sqrt{b})(a^2+\\sqrt{b})",
          "domain": "a any real and b>0, the latter explicitly stipulated; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "Expansion is (a^2)^2-(sqrt(b))^2=a^4-b."
        },
        {
          "label": "k", "source_label": "л", "answer": "(5\\sqrt{a}-4\\sqrt{b})(5\\sqrt{a}+4\\sqrt{b})",
          "domain": "a>0 and b>0, as explicitly stipulated; no denominator.",
          "derivation": "Expansion is (5sqrt(a))^2-(4sqrt(b))^2=25a-16b."
        },
        {
          "label": "l", "source_label": "м", "answer": "(a\\sqrt{3}-b\\sqrt{2})(a\\sqrt{3}+b\\sqrt{2})",
          "domain": "a,b any real; no variable radicand or denominator.",
          "derivation": "Expansion is (a sqrt(3))^2-(b sqrt(2))^2=3a^2-2b^2. The factors use a sqrt(3) and b sqrt(2), not an unjustified replacement sqrt(a^2)=a for negative a."
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
